{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791287280, "covers_from": "2026-10-06T11:48:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-06T11:49:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791287340, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-06T11:48:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 57878, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "關於都市環境林欽榮、林洲民、曹正…等，都是非常優秀的人選…尤其曹老師雖然年齡稍長，但邏輯清晰，請查照", "display_name": "信義代表 Yen Lin", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T11:48:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 57879, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "路過台北市的水溝只要站在上面稍稍停留就會聞到惡臭，也時常看到蟑螂跑來跑去，偶爾見老鼠", "display_name": "大安代表 YoonA", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T11:48:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 57880, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "每天走在路上、帶著寶寶都會一直聞到二手菸，尤其邊走邊抽的人，下雨天在騎樓內抽菸，希望可以加強取締", "display_name": "大安代表 No.57,880", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T11:48:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 57881, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "體育", "content": "天母棒球場容量不足、巨蛋場租高檔期滿、新莊球場老舊腹地小，雙北需要新的戶外棒球場！", "display_name": "士林代表 No.57,881", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T11:48:58+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 57882, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "我發現應該是台電的智慧電網配置，路上的變電箱變多，但是變電箱設置好像完全不理會路人動線，很多很擋路。", "display_name": "大同代表 彥龍", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 57879, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 YoonA", "district": "daan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 57880, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.57,880", "district": "daan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_n